                                "sense_id": "f819e70b-c92b-352e-806e-eb49ee0725fa",
                                "text": "He did particularly run over every one of the officers and commanders, and shewed me how I had reason to mistrust every one of them, either for their falsenesse or their overgreat power, being too high to fasten a real friendship in, and did give me a common but a most excellent [saying] to observe in all my life."
                            },
